12. Temporary Files

Usage of:

/tmp
/var/tmp
%TEMP%
%TMP%

does not automatically indicate OS coupling.

Typical classification:

LOW

Increase severity if the application assumes:

Persistence across restart

Host-level sharing

Specific filesystem semantics

Specific locking behavior

Specific cleanup behavior

Shared files between hosts

13. Hardcoded Working Directory

Example:

