This creates environment sensitivity because different launch mechanisms may use different working directories.

Possible environments:

Docker

Kubernetes

ECS

systemd

cron

Control-M

Jenkins

shell scripts

Typical classification:

LOW/MEDIUM

Prefer explicit configuration:

CONFIG_PATH=/config/config.yaml

